  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "岩屑是钻头破碎岩石后带回地面的碎片。录井人员观察这些碎片，记录钻过了什么岩石、它在哪个井段发生变化。本例先讲清岩屑和岩性的关系，再用图像分类辅助整理一盘混合样品。",
      "judge": [
        {
          "label": "默认数据",
          "value": "教学合成",
          "desc": "公开实测附加区单独标识"
        },
        {
          "label": "业务问题",
          "value": "从一盘岩屑，怎样认识井下的岩石？",
          "desc": "输出边界见说明"
        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "title": "先认识岩屑：地面的一盘碎片，为什么能说明井下岩石？",
          "html": "<div class=\"knowledge-text\" style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.95\"><p>钻井是在地下不断破岩、加深井眼。钻头切下的小碎片称为<b>岩屑</b>，钻井液把它们带到地面，振动筛再把固体从液体中分开。采样、清洗后，录井人员用肉眼或显微镜观察岩屑，形成一段井深的岩性记录。</p><figure class=\"knowledge-figure\" data-knowledge-figure=\"m1-origin\" style=\"margin:24px 0;padding:20px;background:#f7faf9;border:1px solid #dbe6e5;border-radius:12px\"><div class=\"knowledge-figure-title\" style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px\"><span style=\"color:#19786e;font-size:15px\">图 1</span><b style=\"font-size:19px\">岩屑从井底到样品盘，经历了什么？</b><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#617983\">概念示意</span></div><div class=\"knowledge-figure-art\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"图示可横向滚动\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"岩屑从井底到样品盘，经历了什么？\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;min-width:760px;max-width:920px;margin:auto\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"12\" width=\"168\" height=\"156\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7efdf\" stroke=\"#d9e3e7\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#263d46\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"600\">01  井底破岩</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#617983\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">钻头切下岩石碎片</text><line x1=\"182\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M186.8959760788259,91.91468980700107 L195,88 L186.8959760788259,84.08531019299893\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"12\" width=\"168\" height=\"156\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#edf5f2\" stroke=\"#d9e3e7\"/><text x=\"214\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#263d46\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"600\">02  环空上返</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#617983\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">钻井液携带岩屑</text><line x1=\"374\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"387\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M378.8959760788259,91.91468980700107 L387,88 L378.8959760788259,84.08531019299893\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"392\" y=\"12\" width=\"168\" height=\"156\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#edf5f2\" stroke=\"#d9e3e7\"/><text x=\"406\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#263d46\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"600\">03  地面分离</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#617983\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">振动筛分出固体</text><line x1=\"566\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"579\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M570.8959760788259,91.91468980700107 L579,88 L570.8959760788259,84.08531019299893\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"584\" y=\"12\" width=\"168\" height=\"156\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#edf5f2\" stroke=\"#d9e3e7\"/><text x=\"598\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#263d46\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"600\">04  采样观察</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#617983\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">清洗、编号、辨认</text><rect x=\"67\" y=\"61\" width=\"50\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#8495a1\" stroke=\"#8495a1\"/><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"49\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"61\" stroke=\"#263d46\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><polyline points=\"68,85 78,96 88,85 98,96 108,85 117,96\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#263d46\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"107\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#d6ae6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"110\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#d6ae6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"121\" cy=\"107\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#d6ae6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"246\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"67\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M249.91468980700108,75.10402392117409 L246,67 L242.08531019299892,75.10402392117409\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"277\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"277\" y2=\"67\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M280.9146898070011,75.10402392117409 L277,67 L273.0853101929989,75.10402392117409\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"67\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M311.9146898070011,75.10402392117409 L308,67 L304.0853101929989,75.10402392117409\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#19786e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#537eab\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><polyline points=\"416,78 519,78 505,99 430,99 416,78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8495a1\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"444\" y1=\"103\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#8495a1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"494\" y1=\"103\" x2=\"498\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#8495a1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"449\" cy=\"69\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d6ae6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"478\" cy=\"71\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d6ae6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"498\" cy=\"65\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d6ae6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"616\" y=\"64\" width=\"87\" height=\"49\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8495a1\"/><circle cx=\"633\" cy=\"79\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#d6ae6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"653\" cy=\"97\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8495a1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"678\" cy=\"79\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#d6ae6b\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"690\" cy=\"97\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8495a1\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"716\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#537eab\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M707.8959760788259,199.91468980700108 L716,196 L707.8959760788259,192.08531019299892\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#537eab\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"378\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#537eab\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">地面收到样品的时刻，比井底破岩的时刻更晚</text><text x=\"378\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#617983\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">按迟到归位到来源井段，再结合采样记录解释。</text></g></svg></div><figcaption style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;margin-top:14px;color:#506871\"><b style=\"color:#19786e\">读图：</b>顺着箭头看四步。样品盘对应的是更早产生的碎片，记录时要把采样时刻与来源井段联系起来。</figcaption></figure><p><b>岩性</b>是对岩石物质组成和外观结构等特征的描述，例如砂岩、泥岩、灰岩。它帮助我们认识地层变化；储层判断还要继续看孔隙、渗流能力和流体信息。因此，先认清岩石，是后续解释的基础。</p><figure class=\"knowledge-figure\" data-knowledge-figure=\"m1-rocks\" style=\"margin:24px 0;padding:20px;background:#f7faf9;border:1px solid #dbe6e5;border-radius:12px\"><div class=\"knowledge-figure-title\" style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px\"><span style=\"color:#19786e;font-size:15px\">图 2</span><b style=\"font-size:19px\">先看结构，再把颜色放进来一起判断</b><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#617983\">外观特征示意</span></div><div class=\"knowledge-figure-art\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"图示可横向滚动\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 255\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"先看结构，再把颜色放进来一起判断\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;min-width:760px;max-width:920px;margin:auto\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"7\" width=\"236\" height=\"236\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d9e3e7\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#263d46\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">砂岩</text><rect x=\"28\" y=\"56\" width=\"196\" height=\"119\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#efe0bf\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"70\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b88c47\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"87\" cy=\"101\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#b88c47\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"134\" cy=\"132\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#b88c47\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"181\" cy=\"73\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b88c47\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"104\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#b88c47\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"105\" cy=\"135\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#b88c47\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1\